culuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974834_1473009003386628_5395154856041831416_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QV46lYy3CQcQ7kNvwHDfAF5&_nc_oc=AdoLYyBsIlilYdMg-5llyWQWeS3rW-X6IRU9AoPznvnDPoOtrD2zr2BpogjrKLe6i8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af82fdUx5XUIt_Q3GOlOmF1hMWmxlqMd5a0OT9R3P84IPg&oe=6A411B51"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5.png", "id": "951903810294618", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974503_951903813627951_935484385240937317_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SRLGbpGrzVUQ7kNvwGS9JPs&_nc_oc=Adow2vmvlbE0ypoZoJeRV7a8jPCzuG8vUT2_J0eBx4pVQoeOKW21HmTgAQJZcTYlUkg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_9ZUUT-Rv6YQEk88bI4xwT0cc_EZqA-IXZPaaT2vXMiA&oe=6A410E75"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Modoium", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Modoium : The New Standard in Unity Development\n\nDeveloping Android, iOS, iPad or VR content with Unity? Revolutionize your development process with Modoium.\n\n**Key Features :**\n1. Instant Testing: See results on your test devices without building and installing the entire project.\n2. Superior Quality: Automatically supports native resolution and frame rate of test devices, delivering top-notch visuals and audio.\n3. Wireless Connection: Easily connect via Wi-Fi and use multiple devices on the local network.\n4. Multi-Platform Support: Covers iOS, Android, PadOS and VR.\n5. Security: Prevents unauthorized access through verification codes.\n\n**Why Modoium?**\n- Time-Saving: Escape the endless cycle of building, installing, and testing.\n- Increased Productivity: Speed up development with instant feedback.\n- Improved Quality: Verify exact performance on real devices.\n- Cost-Effective: Reduce the need for multiple test devices.\n\nUpgrade your Unity development experience with Modoium. Start now!", "short_description": "Modoium is a Unity mobile game development test 